sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Org as Организатор (клиент)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant PS as purchase-service
    participant PT as participation-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant SS as settlement-service
    participant NS as notification-service
    participant DS as discovery-service

    Org->>GW: POST /api/v1/purchases/{id}/close-recruitment<br/>Authorization JWT, Idempotency-Key
    Note over GW: проверить JWT, rate limit
    GW->>PS: POST /api/v1/purchases/{id}/close-recruitment
    Note over PS: tx: проверить владельца, OPEN → CLOSING, создать сагу sagaId

    Note over PS,PT: Шаг 1. Фиксация участников (синхронно)
    PS->>PT: POST /internal/v1/purchases/{id}/freeze<br/>Idempotency-Key = sagaId, minTotalQuantity
    Note over PT: tx: набрано ≥ минимума, ACTIVE → FROZEN, блокировка закупки
    PT-->>PS: 200 totalQuantity = 10.5, participantsCount = 6
    Note over PS: tx: finalUnitPrice по ступеням цены, запись в outbox
    PS-->>GW: 202 Accepted, status = CLOSING
    GW-->>Org: 202 Accepted

    Note over PS,SS: Шаг 2. Расчёт начислений (асинхронно)
    PS--)K: purchase.closing-started (топик purchases)
    K--)SS: purchase.closing-started
    SS->>PT: GET /internal/v1/purchases/{id}/participations?page=0&size=200
    PT-->>SS: 200 список userId + quantity
    Note over SS: tx: создать начисления PRELIMINARY, запись в outbox
    SS--)K: settlement.charges-created + settlement.charge-issued × N (топик settlements)

    Note over PS,NS: Шаг 3. Завершение саги и оповещения
    K--)PS: settlement.charges-created
    Note over PS: tx: CLOSING → RECRUITMENT_CLOSED, сага COMPLETED, запись в outbox
    PS--)K: purchase.recruitment-closed
    K--)DS: purchase.recruitment-closed → удалить из поискового индекса
    K--)NS: settlement.charge-issued → письма участникам с суммой
    K--)NS: purchase.recruitment-closed → письмо организатору

    Org->>GW: GET /api/v1/purchases/{id} (опрос)
    GW->>PS: GET /api/v1/purchases/{id}
    PS-->>Org: 200 status = RECRUITMENT_CLOSED
